check 1
# An Act V barbarian (Bash, Stun) hireling against an idle target: ScnBar (expansion Barbarian,
# level 30) with hireling row Id 24 (name index 3, seed 0x12345678,
# 100,000 experience), -seed 1234; warp to the Blood Moor (level 2;
# variant blood-moor-empty: no monster population) before frame 4 (the
# hireling follows, world/hirelings.md §6), a cow (class 179, AI Idle:
# no draws, monsters/ai-bodies.md §9.2) 6 sub-tiles away along +x
# before frame 10; no input. Compares the hireling's AI, its skills and
# their damage on the cow. Area F2 (q-diff-skills-2).
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name merc-barb-cow
save ScnBar --class bar --expansion --level 30 --merc 24,3,0x12345678,100000
seed 1234
ticks 120
seconds 330
channels state
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke warp 2
at 10 poke spawn 179 @x+6 @y normal
